# Copy to .env, fill in two or three lines, start.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#   docker compose up -d --build
#
# Everything about the network — the settlement contract, the chain, a public
# RPC, the bootstrap peers — is built into the worker. You name what this box
# serves, what it charges, and where the money goes.

# 1. What this box serves. At least one.

# OpenAI-compatible server (vLLM, SGLang, llama.cpp, …). Comma-separate several.
ROOTMODE_VLLM=http://127.0.0.1:8000
# ComfyUI, for images (official default port 8188).
# ROOTMODE_COMFYUI=http://127.0.0.1:8188

# 2. What it charges. Unset = free — clients pick the cheapest, and a free
#    node never touches the chain.

# Per million tokens, every model the server reports.
ROOTMODE_VLLM_PRICE=0.15
# Per image, every checkpoint.
# ROOTMODE_COMFYUI_PRICE=0.02

# 3. Where the 90% USDC lands. Any Base address; a cold wallet is fine.
#    Leave it unset and earnings accrue to the node's own settle key (minted
#    on the volume, logged on start) until you name one.
ROOTMODE_PAYOUT=0x…

# That is all a paid node needs. On first start it logs its settle key
# ("settle signer 0x…"); send that address a little ETH on Base for gas
# (0.002 ETH is thousands of settles). See docs/WORKER.md.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional.

# Shown to clients. Empty = the machine's hostname.
# ROOTMODE_LABEL=
# ROOTMODE_COUNTRY=US
# ROOTMODE_MAX_CONCURRENT=2

# Per-model prices: id=amount,id=amount (win over the flat price above).
# ROOTMODE_VLLM_PRICES=meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct=0.40
# ROOTMODE_COMFYUI_PRICES=sdxl=0.02,flux1-dev=0.05,krea2-turbo=0.08
# ROOTMODE_VLLM_API_KEY=
# ROOTMODE_VLLM_MODELS=
# ROOTMODE_CURRENCY=USD

# ComfyUI pipelines with a shape of their own — LoRAs, ControlNet, Flux graphs.
# ROOTMODE_COMFYUI_CHECKPOINT=
# ROOTMODE_COMFYUI_WORKFLOW=/etc/rootmode/workflows/my_workflow.json
# ROOTMODE_COMFYUI_WORKFLOWS=krea2=/etc/rootmode/workflows/krea2.json
# ROOTMODE_COMFYUI_SLOTS=prompt=6.inputs.text,seed=3.inputs.seed

# Bring your own settle key instead of the minted one (32-byte hex, the shape
# MetaMask exports). Gas only — revenue goes to ROOTMODE_PAYOUT.
# ROOTMODE_PAY_KEY=

# The network settings built into the worker. Shown so you can see them; set
# one only to point at a different deployment.
# ROOTMODE_POT=0x811544168635F23C2F31aD5d9aAD874Bd8A4D5a9   # RootmodePot on Base
# ROOTMODE_CHAIN_ID=8453                                     # Base
# ROOTMODE_RPC=https://mainnet.base.org                      # fails over to other public Base RPCs
# ROOTMODE_BOOTSTRAP=/dns4/bootstrap.rootmode.ai/tcp/4001/p2p/12D3KooWLXbwVxwKHvEEMdbEbNCv49wVUKc2mieGZfDGw73hj3YW
# ROOTMODE_P2P_EXTERNAL=/ip4/203.0.113.10/tcp/4101           # address to advertise, if not what it binds
